1
00:00:01,000 --> 00:00:07,000
Threatened by a ruthless demon, humanity was on the brink of destruction.

2
00:00:11,000 --> 00:00:16,000
All seemed lost until a lone mage stepped forward and took up the fight.

3
00:00:22,000 --> 00:00:29,000
After his triumph, he was hailed as the Wizard King, and his story became legend.

4
00:00:30,000 --> 00:00:38,000
Following their battle at the Underwater Temple, Yami, Asta, Charmy, and Finral reported to the Wizard King. But then...

5
00:00:38,000 --> 00:00:46,000
Please forgive the intrusion, sir. It's Kitan, a border village in sight of frequent skirmishes with the Diamonds Kingdom. A diamond unit is attacking it as we speak!

6
00:00:50,000 --> 00:00:53,000
Whoa! That looks like a whole army of them!

7
00:00:53,000 --> 00:00:55,000
Three of the eight Shining Generals.

8
00:00:55,000 --> 00:00:58,000
The eight Shining Generals? I've never heard of them before!

9
00:00:58,000 --> 00:01:05,000
They're the eight most powerful people in the whole Diamond Kingdom. You might think of them as being kinda like our Magic Knight Captains.

10
00:01:05,000 --> 00:01:15,000
One squad rushed to Kitan's aid in this critical time of need.

11
00:01:15,000 --> 00:01:16,000
Wait, hold on! Is that...

12
00:01:17,000 --> 00:01:20,000
The mightiest Magic Knight Squad in the Clover Kingdom!

13
00:01:22,000 --> 00:01:23,000
The Golden Dawn!

14
00:01:23,000 --> 00:01:24,000
Nothing done!

15
00:01:24,000 --> 00:01:29,000
Yami and his knights quickly headed for Kai'un to provide additional backup.

16
00:01:31,000 --> 00:01:33,000
Okay, Yuno. I'm coming!

17
00:01:37,000 --> 00:01:41,000
By the time we're done, those Diamond Kingdom mages will regret ever setting foot in our country.

18
00:01:41,000 --> 00:01:42,000
Oh, that's so pretty!

19
00:01:42,000 --> 00:01:43,000
What happened to me today?

20
00:01:43,000 --> 00:01:44,000
Hey!

21
00:01:44,000 --> 00:01:46,000
That's right now.

