68
00:05:43,620 --> 00:05:46,620
I can protect myself and all my friends.

69
00:05:46,620 --> 00:05:50,620
You heard him! You know when I are one soul. Isn't that right?

70
00:05:51,620 --> 00:05:56,620
Uh, hello? Not gonna respond? Could you at least give me a quick yes or no?

71
00:05:57,620 --> 00:05:58,620
No.

72
00:05:58,620 --> 00:06:01,620
You know what? I changed my mind! I need an explanation!

73
00:06:02,620 --> 00:06:05,620
I bet you want me to help now, don't you, Lagos?

74
00:06:05,620 --> 00:06:10,620
How dared that little upstart make a fool of me? I'll handle him myself.

75
00:06:10,620 --> 00:06:12,620
Out of my way, Brox!

76
00:06:12,620 --> 00:06:15,620
I told you before! Leave the twerp to me!

77
00:06:15,620 --> 00:06:16,620
He's mine!

78
00:06:16,620 --> 00:06:17,620
No, he's mine!

79
00:06:17,620 --> 00:06:18,620
He's mine, I said!

80
00:06:18,620 --> 00:06:19,620
