Look at that.

84
00:06:29,620 --> 00:06:33,620
He's gotten so much stronger since we first met inside that dungeon.

85
00:06:34,620 --> 00:06:36,620
It's a crying shame how fast they grow up.

86
00:06:36,620 --> 00:06:38,620
Makes me feel like an old man.

87
