91
00:06:50,620 --> 00:06:53,620
They won't even let me wash my underwear with their clothes.

92
00:06:54,620 --> 00:06:55,620
General Lotus?

93
00:06:55,620 --> 00:06:58,620
They say, leave us alone daddy, you have onion breath.

94
00:07:05,620 --> 00:07:08,620
Now, steal creation magic, fear spiral less!

95
00:07:12,620 --> 00:07:13,620
Damn, there's so many!

96
00:07:13,620 --> 00:07:30,620
This is bad. They've got us outnumbered.

97
00:07:30,620 --> 00:07:33,620
This is bad. They've got us outnumbered.

98
