This magic is clinging to us. It makes it so our spells don't work properly!

100
00:07:54,620 --> 00:07:55,620
Here!

101
00:07:56,620 --> 00:07:59,620
It's Mucca's creation magic, known as Mucca Snail.

102
00:08:00,620 --> 00:08:04,620
A powerful spell that dramatically reduces the abilities of anyone it touches.

103
00:08:05,620 --> 00:08:09,620
You can find it all you want, but there's no escape!

104
00:08:10,620 --> 00:08:13,620
Caring to see pitiful fools like you, writhing in agony.

105
00:08:13,620 --> 00:08:15,620
Oh, it's such a thrill!

106
