108
00:08:38,620 --> 00:08:40,620
What kind of attack is that?

109
00:08:41,620 --> 00:08:42,620
Spatial magic?

110
00:08:44,620 --> 00:08:52,620
Right. That's the problem with this spell. It destroys everything.

111
