161
00:13:04,620 --> 00:13:08,620
We're Magic Knights, so it's our duty to protect the Clover Kingdom from danger.

162
00:13:08,620 --> 00:13:13,620
Hey, after this, why don't we go out for some tea? Sound good?

163
00:13:17,620 --> 00:13:20,620
Uh-oh. Chin up. Don't cry!

164
00:13:23,620 --> 00:13:24,620
Huh?

165
00:13:25,620 --> 00:13:28,620
That's strange. Someone's fighting one of their guys solo up there.

166
00:13:29,620 --> 00:13:30,620
Huh?

167
00:13:30,620 --> 00:13:36,620
That's Yuno!

168
00:13:37,620 --> 00:13:38,620
Careful, my prince!

169
00:13:40,620 --> 00:13:42,620
Go! Go! P-O-P!

170
00:13:43,620 --> 00:13:47,620
When you win, please bring some food to me! Yeah!

171
00:13:47,620 --> 00:13:48,620
Yeah!

172
00:13:48,620 --> 00:13:49,620
Ugh!

173
00:13:49,620 --> 00:13:50,620
Huh?

174
00:13:50,620 --> 00:13:51,620
Huh?

175
00:13:51,620 --> 00:13:53,620
Huh?

176
00:13:55,620 --> 00:13:56,620
Huh?

177
00:14:08,620 --> 00:14:09,620
Huh?

178
00:14:10,620 --> 00:14:11,620
Huh?

179
00:14:12,620 --> 00:14:14,620
Huh?

180
00:14:14,620 --> 00:14:22,260
I had no idea he was this strong.

181
00:14:23,340 --> 00:14:26,180
But as a Shining General, I won't be beaten.

182
00:14:28,680 --> 00:14:31,960
You will surrender to my beautiful magic!

183
00:14:33,120 --> 00:14:34,700
Who cares about that, dude?

184
00:14:39,220 --> 00:14:41,720
Beauty doesn't mean a thing during battle.

185
00:14:44,620 --> 00:14:50,440
To win, you have to be strong.

186
00:14:53,320 --> 00:14:55,060
It's so beautiful.

187
00:14:59,260 --> 00:15:01,100
The Noctumel with one spell!

188
00:15:02,220 --> 00:15:05,300
Ah, the winds of love. My sweet prince.

189
00:15:08,140 --> 00:15:10,760
Thought I saw a familiar speck down here.

190
00:15:11,920 --> 00:15:13,500
So what brings you to Kitan?

191
00:15:14,480 --> 00:15:14,920
Asta.

192
00:15:16,380 --> 00:15:18,760
That guy joined the Magic Knights when Asta did.

193
00:15:19,880 --> 00:15:23,740
And why are you scrambling around looking all beaten up and covered in sweat?

194
00:15:24,860 --> 00:15:25,880
So gross.

195
00:15:26,460 --> 00:15:28,680
He worked his way up to the Golden Dawn Elite?

196
00:15:29,080 --> 00:15:31,500
A guy like him makes the Black Bulls look wimpy.

197
00:15:31,940 --> 00:15:32,720
Plus he's handsome.

198
00:15:33,280 --> 00:15:34,600
Bet he's popular too.

199
00:15:34,600 --> 00:15:41,400
If you got those injuries while fighting someone like I think you did, then that must mean you got stronger again.

200
00:15:41,860 --> 00:15:44,120
I won't lose. Got that?

201
00:15:44,560 --> 00:15:44,860
Huh?

202
00:15:44,860 --> 00:15:47,860
Is he smiling?

203
00:15:50,320 --> 00:15:52,620
Wow. Such a great smile.

204
00:15:52,860 --> 00:15:56,100
I could have a hundred helpings of it and still be asking for more?

205
00:15:56,100 --> 00:16:01,440
Not just me. Looks like you've gotten more powerful too.

206
00:16:02,360 --> 00:16:04,760
But I won't lose either. No way!

207
00:16:04,760 --> 00:16:11,720
So he's a Golden Dawn Elite with good looks for days and his magic abilities off the charts?

208
00:16:11,720 --> 00:16:18,980
But he's competing with Asta. A member of the Black Bulls who's a total meathead. With no magic.

209
00:16:18,980 --> 00:16:23,440
Seems like those two make pretty good rivals.

210
00:16:24,580 --> 00:16:25,700
There you are, Yuno!

211
00:16:27,320 --> 00:16:29,120
Thank goodness you're not injured.

212
00:16:29,680 --> 00:16:30,660
And Asta too?

213
00:16:32,040 --> 00:16:33,200
