215
00:16:35,540 --> 00:16:37,460
Let's see. Does it hurt when I do this?

216
00:16:39,620 --> 00:16:43,340
Of course I didn't ask you that because I'm worried or anything.

217
00:16:44,640 --> 00:16:47,680
You should have never let your guard down, fool.

218
00:16:47,680 --> 00:16:49,380
Uh, sorry?

219
00:16:49,900 --> 00:16:51,800
