222
00:17:02,220 --> 00:17:05,000
Precisely. We don't have time to deal with you, Asta.

223
00:17:08,520 --> 00:17:09,020
Mimosa!

224
00:17:09,400 --> 00:17:09,740
Ready!

225
00:17:10,940 --> 00:17:12,880
You two should stay together for now.

226
00:17:13,700 --> 00:17:16,020
I'm sure it's difficult to fight without your arms.

227
00:17:16,020 --> 00:17:18,800
Not that I'm coddling you or anything.

228
00:17:19,760 --> 00:17:21,020
You can leave now.

229
00:17:21,980 --> 00:17:22,940
Bye, Asta!

230
00:17:24,080 --> 00:17:25,240
Please take care!

231
00:17:25,240 --> 00:17:26,200
Bye!

232
00:17:26,200 --> 00:17:26,820
See ya!

233
00:17:34,740 --> 00:17:40,920
Well, well, well.

234
00:17:42,040 --> 00:17:43,540
So that's where you were.

235
00:17:43,980 --> 00:17:46,360
You must be the Golden Dawn's captain.

236
00:17:46,360 --> 00:17:52,440
I underestimated you. This is some serious magic power you've got.

237
00:17:53,440 --> 00:17:55,960
Yes, and I could say the same about you as well.

238
00:17:56,520 --> 00:18:01,160
You shouldn't die in vain. Take your comrades and leave this land.

239
00:18:01,380 --> 00:18:02,640
What did you say to me?

240
00:18:04,480 --> 00:18:08,020
Diamond soldiers don't retreat, no matter the circumstance.

241
00:18:08,960 --> 00:18:09,440
Never!

242
00:18:11,300 --> 00:18:14,840
Red Clay creation magic! Brilliant armor!

243
00:18:15,600 --> 00:18:16,800
Heavy artillery!

244
00:18:18,760 --> 00:18:22,260
That was pathetic! Was that supposed to be painful?

245
00:18:23,020 --> 00:18:27,740
Ha ha ha ha ha ha! Let me guess. You've already run out of magic.

246
00:18:35,240 --> 00:18:38,500
World Tree Magic. Mistiltane Seed.

247
00:18:39,880 --> 00:18:41,800
You should be honored, you know.

248
00:18:41,800 --> 00:18:46,260
Your magic is being used for the nourishment of the Clover Kingdom.

249
00:18:51,600 --> 00:18:54,780
It's an ambush. He must have concealed his power.

250
00:18:57,980 --> 00:18:58,500
Yami!

